<p>I don't know, this is a little on the nose, even for a Little Mister.</p>
<p>Ms. Sweetie is one of the ones we've been waiting for for a long time, so there's a lot of build up. I don't think there's enough to this one to feel satisfied. Outside of expectations though I still would think there's just not enough here. She needs sugar but her body can't handle it (that part at least seems Wondertainment-y), men don't like her and she turns men into candy? There's not really a hook.</p>
<p>Edit: spelling</p>

